NAME
     clocksyncd – clock management and interface for time synchronization
     related features such as the Precision Time Protocol and USB SSAM.

SYNOPSIS
     clocksyncd

DESCRIPTION
     The clocksyncd executable is used for the management of various
     clock/timing sources and the interface between applications and those
     sources.

     clocksyncd is launched automatically by launched as needed on demand and
     should not be launched manually.

